        "original_id": "cbe9c702-9290-50e4-905b-f97194ddfb02",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: The Cab, Never Shout Never, Hey Monday\n- Publications: Alternative Press\n- Discographies: The Cab discography\n- Places: Joplin, Missouri\n- Topics: music releases, band recognition\n\nFacts:\n- In 2007, Never Shout Never was formed in Joplin, Missouri, as an American rock band.\n- In 2008, Alternative Press called The Cab \"The Band You Need to Know 2008.\"\n- In 2010, Alternative Press featured The Cab in its \"100 Bands You Need to Know in 2010\" list.\n- In 2010, The Cab was one of three bands on the cover page of Alternative Press with Never Shout Never and Hey Monday.\n- The Cab is an American rock band.\n- The Cab has released two studio albums, four extended plays, nine singles, and eight music videos.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
